    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Kratos",
    "summary": "When you select this unit to shoot with close-quarters shooting in your Shooting phase, its attacks against a unit that is engaged with it may ignore any modifiers to BS and to Hit rolls. Also, for each of its [BLAST] weapons you may choose that the weapon loses [BLAST], which restricts that weapon to targeting an enemy unit with which no other friendly unit is engaged.",
